                                                                                
 Usage: sbc-imager build [OPTIONS]                                              
                                                                                
 Build, verify, and atomically publish a card image.                            
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ *  --manifest                <file>  Manifest path. [required]               │
│    --output                  <path>  Output image path.                      │
│    --size                    <str>   Image size or auto; cannot be combined  │
│                                      with --expand.                          │
│    --reserve                 <str>   Free space reserve.                     │
│    --device                  <str>   Target disk to size from: diskN,        │
│                                      /dev/diskN, or /dev/rdiskN. Requires    │
│                                      --expand.                               │
│    --expand                          Size the image to the --device disk;    │
│                                      never writes it.                        │
│    --allow-builtin-sd                Permit an internal SD reader with       │
│                                      --device.                               │
│    --offline                                                                 │
│    --force                                                                   │
│    --keep-work                                                               │
│    --allow-branch                                                            │
│    --json                                                                    │
│    --help                            Show this message and exit.             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

